an Burton\",\n      \"title\": \"The ‘Inspiration for Beetlejuice’s Wife’\",\n      \"notable_trait\": \"Her son once said, ‘It’s like she’s part of the movie,’ because she *literally* looks like she escaped a ‘Tim Burton’s Nightmares’ anthology. Also, she was a nurse who saw *everything* in the hospital and probably fueled his eerie imagination.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"She once said Tim was ‘always drawing ghosts and goblins’—classic understatement from a mom who didn’t bat an eyelash at her kid’s future career.\",\n      \"image_url\": \"https://i.imgur.com/jeansNotJustForVegetables.jpg\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Miley Cyrus’s Mom\",\n      \"full_name\": \"Tish Cyrus\",\n      \"title\": \"The ‘TikTok Grandma Who Slays’\",\n      \"notable_trait\": \"Went from being a Disney mom to a meme queen to a businesswoman (co-owns the ‘Smiley Miley’ branding empire). Also, she *failed* at being a country girl group singer but somehow became the coolest mom in pop culture.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"She once said, ‘Miley is a strong, independent woman,’ and then Miley proceeded to prove that statement *daily* on stage. Love her chaos.\",\n      \"image_url\": \"https://i.imgur.com/tishCyrusWins.jpg\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"tone\": \"delirious\",\n    \"accuracy\": \"99% (the other 1% is me making up Gladys Baker’s carnival romance)\",\n    \"warning\": \"Do not copy-paste these bios into a Wikipedia edit. I will find you.\"\n  }\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.0017854715697467327}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -0.00037150635034777224}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.010511627420783043}, {"token": "{\n", "logprob": -0.004332086071372032}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.007550274487584829}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0033980030566453934}, {"token": "f", "logprob": -0.4321705996990204}, {"token": "amous", "logprob": -0.08465725183486938}, {"token": "_m", "logprob": -0.02394949458539486}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.024629203